        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:domain#e-fb188df27d10cd02",
          "text": "Humans survive change by switching cognitive domains: when one system fails, we turn to another – from symbolic thought to sensory experience.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-mock-fujian-2026-04-provincial-quality-test-a1",
