        {
          "exampleId": "w:domain#e-ba414dd6e912c291",
          "text": "If cross-domain translation is our fundamental adaptive mechanism, succeeding in the AI age means strengthening this ability: identifying domain traps, translating across domains, and building cognitive architectures that facilitate domain switching.",
